1
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:03,860
Set the sails! Top two!

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,260
Let's find the next island! Whoa!

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:07,617
Hey, come on, Luffy!

4
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,237
Can't we rest for a little while?

5
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,957
You're a little too relaxed.

6
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:14,981
Listen, that attitude isn't going
to get us very far on these seas.

7
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,340
I don't think I want to hear this.

8
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:21,457
The waves look a little too strange
for comfort, so it's back to work.

9
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:22,370
Turn to port!

10
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:24,080
Anything for you, Nami dear!

11
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:36,800
Do you see?

12
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,040
It's full speed ahead!

13
00:00:39,360 --> 00:00:41,017
This doesn't look good for us!

14
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:42,217
There's something in the wave!

15
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:43,880
Is that the breeze? No!

16
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,454
Those are sea monkeys!

17
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:05,012
He doesn't seem to be here, Vice Admiral.

18
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:07,240
I know that already, you imbecile.

19
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:09,417
I'm asking you where the hell he went.

20
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:13,180
Since his bicycle is missing
too, he probably went to sea.

21
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:16,540
Contact the five Elder Stars. Sir.

22
00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:21,305
Oh, pardon me, coming through.

23
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:28,277
We should expect this
sort of thing by now.

24
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:30,419
He's likely just sightseeing again.

25
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,260
Be that as it may,

26
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:35,697
don't you think he should show a
bit more respect for his position?

27
00:01:35,780 --> 00:01:39,015
We can't have him wondering
about whenever he sees fit.

28
00:01:40,020 --> 00:01:44,491
Admiral Aokiji is one of Navy Headquarters'
ultimate powerhouses, after all.

29
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:53,237
Can't say I'm surprised to see
a bounty on this kid's head.

30
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:55,732
His whole family's full of troublemakers.

31
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,190
Thank you.
